  "notes": "H7106 is partial in this split (maker/heart/report only) and follows H7100. H7101/H7102 and H7103/H7107 are thin SKUs with only lock/heart/temp config in split. H7111 heart fields 1/6/7 and H7100 field 9 are unnamed placeholders. H7105 custom child field names are obfuscated; layout inferred. H7112 has no local BLE package: opcodes from H7112SharedViewModel (m1=0x09,i1=0x1E,P=0x10,d0=0x05,A=0x08,l1=0x13,P0=0x02,Q0=0x02,S0=0x01,R0=0x01). H7112 AUTO value 02 is overloaded as auto ramp selector."
